    slug: "facebook-lead-ads-vs-landing-pages",
    title: "Facebook Lead Ads vs Landing Pages: Which Converts Better in 2026",
    metaDescription: "Detailed comparison of Facebook Lead Ads vs landing pages for lead generation. Data from 200+ campaigns shows when each converts better and how to maximize both.",
