    slug: "meta-ads-audience-targeting-local-business",
    title: "Meta Ads Audience Targeting for Local Service Businesses: A Data-Driven Approach",
    metaDescription: "Master Meta Ads audience targeting for local businesses. Learn layered targeting, custom audiences, and lookalikes that reduce CPL and increase lead quality.",
    category: "meta-ads",
